<title>UK: London gold fixes touch easier, PGMs off highs.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes touch easier, PGMs off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $344.00, down 25 cents. Very quiet so far, caught in tight range. Market watching PGMs warily. Needs to break through $345.50 to signal upside potential.</p>
<p>SILVER - Easier at $4.76/$4.78, down six cents</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down $4.00 at $460.00/$465.00. Potentially volatile and lightly traded. Very nervous.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Similarly uneasy. $208.00/$213.00, down $13.</p>
</text>
